recommend keep-going the arc has reached a person, which is the door the desist rung pointed at. The next constructive rung is what that person can hand back -- a reader who is called to a wall may answer it, and nothing yet reads an answer to a boundary. The meter names the nearer bound honestly: 2,669 lines of 4,000, about three rungs of headroom, with the chain residue the only part still growing.
